+      "fossil_era_devonian_to_the_end_of_the_cretaceous": "Devonian to the end of the Cretaceous",
+      "fossil_note_14": "Relatives of squid with coiled shells. They died out with the dinosaurs 66 million years ago, and they are classic fossils for dating rocks.",
