+      "fossil_note_26": "Sea urchins, relatives of starfish: round kinds and flattened ones such as sand dollars.",
+      "fossil_note_27": "Molluscs with two shells, such as clams, found in almost every kind of sea-floor sediment.",
+      "fossil_note_28": "Horn-shaped corals, living alone or in colonies. They died out in the great extinction at the end of the Permian.",
